~ start
Ozqn: This is template dialogue that pops up when you don't give a filepath.
Ozqn: You can use the Dialogue panel at the top to make new dialogue
Ozqn: Then you can start the dialogue in a script using the DialogueUI.start(file_path: String) function.
Ozqn: For more information see the online documentation.
- Start again => start
- End the conversation => END
=> END